- **Linux ARM** — `inillucent-1.0.29-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz` (aarch64, glibc 2.28 or newer · 20 MB), SHA-256 `0675572c6efc28b6f4acdb678ae0c942df7c4b940b33a38972afe33c4b7285ad`
