- **Debian and Ubuntu ARM** — `inillucent_1.0.29_arm64.deb` (aarch64 · 19.9 MB), SHA-256 `3d740b01d5e3a603de58acba2503e1a606758e50b65c5d61aee9f94c9c62a0bd`
